    thinking: "**Designing the Logo**\n\nI\'m currently focused on designing a new \"W\" logo for the user. I\'ll be updating `/public/logo.svg` with a beautifully styled \"W\" on a black background, following the user\'s specific request. I plan to write the logo in a new `logo.svg` format.\n\n\n**Refining the \"W\" Shape**\n\nI\'ve been working to refine the \"W\" path for better elegance and visual balance. I\'m exploring an approach using a font-based \"W\" as well. I\'m working with a new constructed shape. My focus is on achieving a more centered and refined appearance.\n\n\n"
